# Personal-data scrub patterns — copy to secrets/scrub-patterns.txt
# (gitignored) and fill with the REAL values. One value per line in
# EVERY spelling it could appear in; `#` starts a comment.
#
# The gate runs from pre-commit (tree) and manually with --history
# (git log --all -S) before any history surgery, release, or push of
# reports: scripts/scrub-check.sh --history --strict
#
# --- categories to cover (delete this block once filled) ---
# DIDs:            +14815550123 / 14815550123 / +48 22 555 01 23 …
# Personal mobile: +49…, +48…, each spelling (spaces, dashes, no plus)
# SIP usernames:   extension and trunk credentials
# Public IPs:      server addresses
# Key IDs/prints:  ssh key fingerprints, Telnyx key prefixes
